@startuml
title Cloud-only content demand with background-process guard
actor User
participant Application as App
participant FUSE as Fuse
database "Item DB" as DB
participant "Process identity guard" as Guard
participant "Existing sync/download engine" as Engine
cloud "Microsoft Graph" as Graph
participant "Physical sync_dir" as Disk

User -> App : open/read file
App -> Fuse : content-requiring operation
Fuse -> DB : resolve item + stable residency
DB --> Fuse : CLOUD_ONLY
Fuse -> Guard : inspect FUSE PID and executable identity
alt recognised indexer / thumbnail worker
  Guard --> Fuse : block automatic hydration
  Fuse --> App : defined filesystem error
  note over Fuse,DB
  No Graph request; no placeholder;
  stable state remains CLOUD_ONLY
  end note
else permitted or unknown process
  Guard --> Fuse : allow hydration
  Fuse -> Engine : request hydration(item identity)
  Engine -> Graph : existing download request
  Graph --> Engine : content stream
  Engine -> Disk : safe temporary download
  Engine -> Engine : validate completed content
  Engine -> Disk : atomically materialise backing file
  Engine -> DB : commit HYDRATED
  Engine --> Fuse : hydration complete
  Fuse -> Disk : read backing content
  Disk --> Fuse : bytes
  Fuse --> App : success
end
@enduml
